# Copy to .devcontainer/devcontainer.env and fill in. That file is gitignored.
#
# Docker reads this file literally: no quotes, no shell expansion, no spaces
# around "=". Uncomment a line to use it — an empty value is worse than an
# absent one, since the tools then see a variable set to the empty string.

# Fine-grained personal access token, scoped to the ceopardy repository only.
# See .devcontainer/README.md for the permissions to grant.
#GITHUB_TOKEN=github_pat_...

# Long-lived Claude Code token. Generate it on the *host* with:
#     claude setup-token
# ~/.claude is not persisted in the container (see README.md), so this is what
# keeps you signed in across rebuilds.
#CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=sk-ant-oat...
